---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Appliance Repair Mooresville NC"
  description="Privacy policy for Appliance Repair Mooresville NC website and contact form."
>
  <section class="py-12 lg:py-16">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none space-y-6 text-gray-700">
        <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> November 2026</p>
        <p>This Privacy Policy describes how Appliance Repair Mooresville NC ("we," "us," or "our") collects, uses, and shares information when you visit our website or contact us.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8">Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>When you use our contact form or call us, you may provide:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
          <li>Name and contact details (phone, email)</li>
          <li>Information about your appliance and service needs</li>
          <li>Location or neighborhood for scheduling</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We may also collect standard web log data such as IP address, browser type, and pages visited through typical server and analytics practices.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8">How We Use Information</h2>
        <p>We use the information you provide to:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
          <li>Respond to service requests and schedule visits</li>
          <li>Communicate about your repair</li>
          <li>Improve our website and services</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8">Sharing</h2>
        <p>We do not sell your personal information. We may share information with service providers who help us operate the website or process form submissions (such as form handling services), solely for those purposes. We may also disclose information if required by law.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8">Contact Forms</h2>
        <p>Our contact form is processed through Web3Forms or a similar third-party service. Their privacy practices apply to data they process on our behalf.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8">Cookies and Tracking</h2>
        <p>Our site may use essential cookies for basic functionality. We do not use advertising trackers. Any future analytics would be configured with privacy in mind.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8">Your Choices</h2>
        <p>You may contact us to update or correct information you have provided, or to request that we limit further contact related to marketing (service-related communication about an active request is separate).</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8">Contact</h2>
        <p>For privacy-related questions, contact us at the phone number or email listed on our Contact page, or write to us at the business address shown on this website.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
